<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Founder Profile | BeatsVibe App</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>body { font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; background-color: #f8fafc; }</style>
</head>
<body class="flex flex-col min-h-screen text-slate-800">
    <!-- App Navbar -->
    <nav class="h-16 bg-white border-b border-slate-200 px-6 flex justify-between items-center sticky top-0 z-50">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 cursor-pointer" onclick="window.location.href='/'">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-blue-600 rounded-lg text-white flex items-center justify-center font-black">B</div>
            <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-wide">BeatsVibe</span>
        </div>
        <button onclick="window.history.back()" class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900"><i class="fas fa-arrow-left mr-2"></i> Go Back</button>
    </nav>

    <main class="flex-1 max-w-4xl mx-auto w-full px-6 py-12">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm overflow-hidden">
            <!-- App-style Cover Banner -->
            <div class="h-48 bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-900 to-blue-900 relative"></div>
            
            <div class="px-8 pb-12 relative">
                <!-- Dynamic Avatar (No Image Dependency) -->
                <div class="w-32 h-32 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-blue-600 to-cyan-400 flex items-center justify-center text-5xl font-black text-white shadow-xl absolute -top-16 border-4 border-white">SR</div>
                
                <div class="pt-20 flex justify-between items-start">
                    <div>
                        <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">Suyash Rathod</h1>
                        <p class="text-blue-600 font-bold mt-1">Founder & Executive Director, BeatsVibe Technologies</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex gap-2">
                        <button class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 hover:bg-blue-50 hover:text-blue-600 transition flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fab fa-linkedin-in"></i></button>
                        <button class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-900 hover:text-white transition flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fab fa-github"></i></button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Professional Profile Data -->
                <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                    <div class="md:col-span-2 space-y-6 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-sm">
                        <p>Suyash Rathod is the engineering architect behind BeatsVibe Technologies. Operating from Nagpur, Maharashtra, he is currently pursuing his B.Tech in Electrical Engineering at Tulshiramji Gaikwad Patil College of Engineering and Technology.</p>
                        <p>Merging deep academic theory with rigorous production deployment, Suyash has extensive professional experience functioning as a Junior DevOps Developer for the Revenue Department, Government of Maharashtra. His architecture heavily involves high-availability CI/CD pipelines, secure networking, and robust database management.</p>
                        <p>An active technical mentor, Suyash has a strong background in teaching computer programming and IT concepts at the Anees Defence Career Institute in Pune. This hands-on instructional experience directly shaped the interactive, execution-first methodology that powers the BeatsVibe learning ecosystem.</p>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Core Competencies Sidebar -->
                    <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-5 border border-slate-100 h-max">
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4 text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">System Architecture</h3>
                        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm font-medium text-slate-600">
                            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fas fa-server text-blue-500 w-4"></i> Cloud & DevOps</li>
                            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fab fa-node-js text-green-500 w-4"></i> MERN Full-Stack</li>
                            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fas fa-microchip text-slate-800 w-4"></i> Electrical Eng.</li>
                            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fas fa-brain text-purple-500 w-4"></i> AI (NeuroNova)</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>
</body>
</html>